WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.770
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.040 --> 00:08.360
Hey!

3
00:08.360 --> 00:09.520
Let me help pick them up.

4
00:09.520 --> 00:10.560
It's okay.

5
00:10.560 --> 00:11.760
What happened in there?

6
00:11.760 --> 00:12.760
Din, let's just go.

7
00:12.760 --> 00:13.760
I'll tell you later.

8
00:14.280 --> 00:16.680
Then from now on, I'll take you to class every day

9
00:16.680 --> 00:18.440
and wait to pick you up, too.

10
00:19.000 --> 00:21.240
Let him do whatever he wants. Don't worry about me.

11
00:21.240 --> 00:22.680
I don't want to go back anymore.

12
00:22.680 --> 00:24.080
There was one I really liked,

13
00:24.080 --> 00:25.720
but it's not in London.

14
00:25.720 --> 00:26.640
What do you think?

15
00:26.640 --> 00:28.960
Study together, or somewhere else?

16
00:28.960 --> 00:32.159
But if we're going together, the same city is easier.

17
00:32.159 --> 00:34.920
And when you're free, go check out the seniors' work at uni.

18
00:34.920 --> 00:36.400
Even if you get some letters right,

19
00:36.400 --> 00:39.200
you'll never guess the last three.

20
00:39.200 --> 00:40.280
Peel some for me too, son.

21
00:40.280 --> 00:42.120
Here you go, sir. All peeled.

22
00:42.120 --> 00:43.720
I'll probably be late on match day.

23
00:43.720 --> 00:44.920
Going to an open house first.

24
00:44.920 --> 00:47.440
I swim so my lungs get stronger.

25
00:47.440 --> 00:49.440
So I can run all day, morning to night.

26
00:49.440 --> 00:51.480
The reason I never gave you a chance

27
00:51.480 --> 00:53.000
is you're all talk,

28
00:53.000 --> 00:54.200
you never really show it.

29
00:54.200 --> 00:56.680
But this time, you're proving it to everyone around you.

30
00:56.680 --> 00:57.520
Not just me.

31
00:57.520 --> 00:58.640
At the match this Sunday,

32
00:58.640 --> 00:59.800
I'll score five goals alone.

33
00:59.800 --> 01:00.920
But if you can't do it...

34
01:00.920 --> 01:02.240
please keep your promise.

35
01:02.240 --> 01:03.200
I can't let you do that.

36
01:03.200 --> 01:04.760
Or you'll be their target all game.

37
01:04.760 --> 01:05.920
But I have to win today.

38
01:05.920 --> 01:07.600
And I'll score five goals on my own.

39
01:09.200 --> 01:10.200
Then why are you here?

40
01:10.200 --> 01:12.039
Does Physics know?

41
01:12.039 --> 01:13.400
Then why didn't you just tell me?

42
01:14.200 --> 01:15.120
Why hide it?

43
01:15.120 --> 01:17.680
I was so damn happy when you said you wanted to go together.

44
01:17.680 --> 01:20.160
If you'd rather stay here, just tell me.

45
01:20.160 --> 01:21.440
You don't have to come with me.

46
01:21.440 --> 01:22.720
It's your life, Fuen.

47
01:58.880 --> 02:00.200
Fuen?

48
02:02.680 --> 02:04.000
What's wrong?

49
02:10.479 --> 02:12.440
I hurt Physics.

50
02:14.040 --> 02:15.880
I didn't fucking think it through.

51
02:18.960 --> 02:21.960
Fuen, can you tell us

52
02:22.800 --> 02:24.000
what happened?

53
02:28.600 --> 02:30.440
I went to the open house

54
02:32.280 --> 02:34.400
and I just assumed

55
02:35.120 --> 02:36.120
it'd be fine.

56
02:36.120 --> 02:37.680
I was only going to look.

57
02:41.520 --> 02:43.440
But Physics thinks

58
02:44.680 --> 02:46.800
I'm thinking of not going with him.

59
02:50.480 --> 02:52.480
I've already decided, Chemi.

60
02:54.040 --> 02:55.600
I'm not having second thoughts.

61
02:59.240 --> 03:01.000
I'm just scared.

62
03:01.560 --> 03:03.440
Scared of being a burden to him.

63
03:05.040 --> 03:06.640
Scared I won't get in.

64
03:09.960 --> 03:10.680
Aof...

65
03:14.240 --> 03:16.079
Just now, he talked like

66
03:16.480 --> 03:18.400
he'd be fine without me.

67
03:21.240 --> 03:23.360
Or am I the only one

68
03:24.320 --> 03:27.000
who can't live without him?

69
03:33.120 --> 03:35.960
I'm not great with feelings and stuff like this.

70
03:37.440 --> 03:39.440
Just trust me this once.

71
03:40.560 --> 03:43.120
Go find Physics right now.

72
03:46.480 --> 03:51.040
Fuen, Physics loves you way more than you think.

73
03:52.040 --> 03:53.480
Trust me on this.

74
03:53.840 --> 03:55.240
He's right, Fuen.

75
03:55.920 --> 03:58.560
My brother loves you so much.

76
03:58.560 --> 03:59.640
He really does.

77
04:13.960 --> 04:15.800
Did I get this one right?

78
04:27.360 --> 04:30.560
"Snacks are out front after class, champ. Study hard."

79
04:41.760 --> 04:43.480
Get some sleep.

80
04:43.480 --> 04:44.920
You can study again tomorrow.

81
04:45.760 --> 04:47.880
But I haven't memorized it all yet.

82
04:50.560 --> 04:52.000
It's fine. I'll help you.

83
04:55.000 --> 04:56.920
Don't worry.

84
05:07.960 --> 05:09.480
Thanks a lot.

85
05:10.520 --> 05:11.520
And...

86
05:13.520 --> 05:14.880
Congrats.

87
05:15.880 --> 05:18.240
But this time, take good care of Chemi.

88
05:21.000 --> 05:22.560
Don't break his heart again.

89
05:25.480 --> 05:27.400
Don't worry about me this time.

90
05:28.440 --> 05:30.080
Worry about yourself.

91
05:33.000 --> 05:34.680
Why'd you have to say that?

92
07:46.760 --> 07:47.800
You okay?

93
07:48.040 --> 07:49.159
Chill.

94
07:57.240 --> 07:58.280
I'm fine. Chill.

95
08:00.840 --> 08:02.560
Let's go to school together tomorrow.

96
08:03.960 --> 08:07.360
Isn't your leg hurt, Aof?

97
08:07.360 --> 08:11.680
And coming this way from your place is a detour.

98
08:11.680 --> 08:13.080
We can just meet at school.

99
08:13.080 --> 08:14.120
It's fine.

100
08:14.920 --> 08:16.000
I'm an athlete.

101
08:16.440 --> 08:17.400
Piece of cake.

102
08:19.640 --> 08:22.240
Don't forget, we've never gone to school together.

103
08:22.800 --> 08:26.320
And once I graduate from this school,

104
08:27.200 --> 08:29.560
we'll never get the chance to go together again.

105
08:36.360 --> 08:37.360
Hmm.

106
08:37.360 --> 08:38.480
Okay.

107
08:39.039 --> 08:41.400
But don't make me late.

108
08:41.400 --> 08:43.520
I'll be here bright and early tomorrow.

109
08:47.680 --> 08:48.680
Aof.

110
08:52.400 --> 08:56.000
I don't know what will happen to us from here.

111
08:59.400 --> 09:01.840
But I'll forget everything that happened before

112
09:05.280 --> 09:09.000
and get to know you all over again.

113
09:11.880 --> 09:15.200
This is the last time.

114
09:15.880 --> 09:17.320
Do it right.

115
09:19.480 --> 09:20.880
I don't want to get hurt again.

116
09:31.200 --> 09:32.320
Thank you, Chemi,

117
09:37.000 --> 09:38.520
for giving me another chance.

118
09:42.560 --> 09:43.720
I promise from now on,

119
09:43.720 --> 09:45.960
I won't give you a reason to let go of me again.

120
09:50.200 --> 09:55.280
Before, I didn't know how to set priorities.

121
09:57.800 --> 10:00.320
I got my priorities all wrong.

122
10:01.240 --> 10:02.400
But now I know

123
10:06.440 --> 10:08.720
how much you mean to me.

124
10:11.080 --> 10:13.080
From now on, I promise

125
10:13.080 --> 10:15.320
you'll be in every thought I have.

126
10:16.440 --> 10:18.720
I won't do anything that hurts you.

127
10:19.600 --> 10:21.720
I won't do anything wrong.

128
10:38.360 --> 10:40.080
I still want to be the best version

129
10:40.080 --> 10:41.800
of myself for you.

130
11:16.560 --> 11:19.640
Thank you.

131
11:31.520 --> 11:32.520
I'm going.

132
11:34.080 --> 11:35.520
You can go home now.

133
11:36.200 --> 11:38.480
Go on in. I'll wait right here.

134
11:39.120 --> 11:40.240
Are you limping?

135
11:42.160 --> 11:43.160
It doesn't hurt.

136
11:43.760 --> 11:44.960
Okay.

137
11:44.960 --> 11:46.960
I'm going now.

138
11:52.040 --> 11:53.040
Bye-bye.

139
11:57.760 --> 12:04.560
Ow, it hurts. Damn, what a day. It fucking hurts. Shit.

140
12:57.040 --> 12:59.200
What are you doing out here alone?

141
12:59.200 --> 13:00.520
You okay?

142
13:19.640 --> 13:20.640
Oh!

143
13:21.320 --> 13:22.720
Hi, Mom.

144
13:22.720 --> 13:24.320
What brings you here so late?

145
13:24.320 --> 13:27.040
Um, Mom, is Physics home yet?

146
13:27.040 --> 13:29.840
Not yet. He's not home yet.

147
13:29.840 --> 13:31.520
Didn't you two meet up?

148
13:32.760 --> 13:36.000
He told me he was sleeping over at your place.

149
13:39.680 --> 13:41.440
Is something going on?

150
13:41.440 --> 13:43.040
Oh, no, Mom.

151
13:43.040 --> 13:45.000
Physics is probably at my place.

152
13:45.000 --> 13:46.120
Don't worry.

153
13:47.000 --> 13:50.400
Okay. But if he comes home, I'll call you.

154
13:50.400 --> 13:53.600
Okay. Thank you so much. Bye.

155
14:04.000 --> 14:05.160
So you're hurt

156
14:05.160 --> 14:06.600
because you think he'd rather study

157
14:06.600 --> 14:08.280
somewhere else than go with you, right?

158
14:11.840 --> 14:14.000
Then let me tell you, that's not true.

159
14:14.400 --> 14:16.160
Fuen wants to go with you.

160
14:16.520 --> 14:17.960
He told me so himself.

161
14:17.960 --> 14:19.440
The only problem is

162
14:19.440 --> 14:21.240
he hasn't told his parents yet.

163
14:22.200 --> 14:24.160
He's afraid his mom won't be okay with it

164
14:24.680 --> 14:27.080
and that he won't get into any university this year.

165
14:29.360 --> 14:33.080
But my guess is he's worried about his portfolio.

166
14:34.800 --> 14:36.120
And I'm the one

167
14:36.120 --> 14:37.120
who told him

168
14:37.120 --> 14:38.880
to go see some really good work.

169
14:43.640 --> 14:44.800
I get it,

170
14:44.800 --> 14:46.840
why you're hurt.

171
14:48.040 --> 14:50.040
But try to understand Fuen, too.

172
14:50.800 --> 14:52.360
He's an only child.

173
14:53.520 --> 14:54.840
Before you came along,

174
14:55.680 --> 14:57.560
he always did everything on his own.

175
15:00.560 --> 15:04.120
So sometimes he might forget to tell you things,

176
15:04.120 --> 15:06.440
or he figures

177
15:06.440 --> 15:08.080
it's no big deal,

178
15:08.080 --> 15:09.400
so he doesn't mention it.

179
15:12.160 --> 15:13.600
But I think he knows now

180
15:14.120 --> 15:16.120
that it's causing problems between you two.

181
15:24.960 --> 15:26.960
Do you think Fuen will change his mind?

182
15:27.600 --> 15:28.760
Ask Fuen.

183
15:28.760 --> 15:31.560
How would I know?

184
16:02.560 --> 16:04.080
Talk it out, okay?

185
16:17.000 --> 16:19.360
Do you know everywhere I looked for you?

186
16:19.720 --> 16:21.960
You weren't fucking anywhere.

187
16:29.160 --> 16:30.160
You told me

188
16:31.240 --> 16:33.160
you hate it when I leave you.

189
16:34.000 --> 16:35.280
I hate it too.

190
17:06.079 --> 17:07.720
I don't fucking care anymore.

191
17:08.319 --> 17:10.480
Over there, I'm going to be your burden.

192
17:10.480 --> 17:12.359
You'll have to take care of everything for me.

193
17:12.800 --> 17:13.800
It's your own fault.

194
17:14.599 --> 17:17.599
You spoiled me. I can't even do what I used to.

195
17:26.160 --> 17:27.440
You said we'd go together.

196
17:28.359 --> 17:29.960
You sold me a dream,

197
17:30.480 --> 17:31.960
and then you ditched me.

198
17:31.960 --> 17:33.480
That's so damn irresponsible.

199
17:37.560 --> 17:39.360
I like taking care of you,

200
17:40.800 --> 17:42.560
looking out for you,

201
17:43.640 --> 17:45.880
seeing you eat well and sleep well.

202
17:47.800 --> 17:50.080
I want to take you everywhere with me.

203
17:51.800 --> 17:53.720
But I'm scared

204
17:55.000 --> 17:58.240
that my love will end up hurting you again.

205
17:59.640 --> 18:00.560
Hurt me how?

206
18:01.360 --> 18:03.400
It's like my dad always said.

207
18:03.400 --> 18:04.400
If it weren't you,

208
18:04.400 --> 18:06.000
no one could put up with me.

209
18:11.600 --> 18:14.920
Physics, I promise

210
18:16.920 --> 18:18.320
I'll talk to you more,

211
18:19.480 --> 18:21.200
even about the little things.

212
18:23.720 --> 18:25.560
Whatever you ask me,

213
18:25.560 --> 18:27.360
I'll answer all of it.

214
18:27.360 --> 18:28.280
I promise.

215
18:30.960 --> 18:31.960
Mm.

216
18:34.960 --> 18:39.240
And I promise, too,

217
18:41.440 --> 18:42.840
I won't let my head

218
18:44.080 --> 18:46.280
convince me you don't need me anymore.

219
19:09.920 --> 19:12.680
I'm glad I have you by my side.

220
19:33.800 --> 19:34.800
I'm sorry.

221
19:37.000 --> 19:38.200
I'm so sorry.

222
20:06.040 --> 20:09.840
"Anyone still up? Look at the sky."

223
20:25.560 --> 20:29.680
"The stars are pretty tonight. It's late, go to bed."

224
21:03.160 --> 21:04.760
Don't make me late.

225
21:04.760 --> 21:05.760
Don't be late.

226
22:17.880 --> 22:19.320
Hi, Mom.

227
22:19.320 --> 22:20.320
How are you, dear?

228
22:20.320 --> 22:21.480
I'm good.

229
22:22.320 --> 22:23.360
I'm off, Mom.

230
22:23.360 --> 22:24.640
Bye.

231
22:26.840 --> 22:27.800
Goodbye.

232
22:29.280 --> 22:30.080
Aof.

233
22:30.080 --> 22:31.360
Yes, Mom?

234
22:33.080 --> 22:35.000
Take good care of him.

235
22:46.640 --> 22:48.320
Yes, Mom.

236
23:17.840 --> 23:19.320
That looks so good.

237
23:20.480 --> 23:22.520
Looks good, so eat up.

238
23:28.040 --> 23:29.280
How is it? Tasty?

239
23:30.000 --> 23:31.120
It's good.

240
23:31.560 --> 23:33.920
I can feed myself. I'm almost done.

241
23:34.560 --> 23:35.720
Your hands hold the book,

242
23:35.720 --> 23:37.040
your eyes read it.

243
23:37.560 --> 23:39.200
As for your mouth, I'll feed you.

244
23:49.880 --> 23:51.840
Can I court you, Time?

245
24:15.360 --> 24:17.720
Star, I have to go take my exam.

246
24:18.120 --> 24:19.600
I'll probably be back this evening.

247
24:20.920 --> 24:22.520
When you get to class,

248
24:22.520 --> 24:24.920
can you post a story so I know?

249
24:26.880 --> 24:28.080
Sure.

250
24:28.600 --> 24:31.800
And give it your all today, Din.

251
24:32.800 --> 24:35.120
I hope everything goes the way you want.

252
24:36.280 --> 24:37.200
Thanks.

253
24:38.520 --> 24:41.520
When your class is over, wait for me there.

254
24:41.920 --> 24:43.040
I'll come get you.

255
24:43.560 --> 24:47.640
Okay. See you later, Din.

256
25:07.520 --> 25:08.600
You said 999!

257
25:09.400 --> 25:11.040
Why is it tens of thousands, Physics?

258
25:12.600 --> 25:13.920
It said 999 in the photo.

259
25:14.920 --> 25:18.000
The actual guitar has a 3 and a 9 tacked on the front.

260
25:18.560 --> 25:19.560
How about that?

261
25:19.560 --> 25:22.160
See the perks of being an only child now?

262
25:22.160 --> 25:24.160
I see the perks of being the youngest.

263
25:24.800 --> 25:26.600
Can I help you?

264
25:27.800 --> 25:29.240
You've got a good eye.

265
25:29.240 --> 25:31.280
But actually, this one's reserved.

266
25:31.760 --> 25:33.320
But if you really want it...

267
25:33.320 --> 25:35.120
Someone reserved it?

268
25:35.680 --> 25:38.000
Is the person who reserved it a boy

269
25:38.000 --> 25:39.360
about this tall,

270
25:39.360 --> 25:41.160
kind of Chinese-looking,

271
25:41.160 --> 25:43.160
with bangs,

272
25:44.320 --> 25:46.680
who comes here a lot to buy guitar picks?

273
25:46.680 --> 25:47.760
That's him.

274
25:47.760 --> 25:50.440
Oh, if that's the case,

275
25:51.080 --> 25:54.280
you can just sell it to me.

276
25:54.280 --> 25:56.520
That's my little brother.

277
25:57.040 --> 25:59.680
Mm. You got it, kid.

278
26:07.400 --> 26:08.640
How's that, big brother?

279
26:09.120 --> 26:12.200
There goes your allowance this term.

280
26:13.800 --> 26:15.760
I'm afraid it won't just be this term.

281
26:26.760 --> 26:29.600
There's a new milk tea place. Want to try it?

282
26:29.600 --> 26:31.120
Really? Where is it?

283
26:31.120 --> 26:33.680
Don't know. We can look it up.

284
27:03.920 --> 27:05.640
You studying hard?

285
27:06.960 --> 27:08.840
I'm studying hard!

286
27:12.200 --> 27:14.080
"Made it to tutoring."

287
27:17.000 --> 27:18.200
Hello, everyone.

288
27:19.360 --> 27:21.600
Open your handouts to page three.

289
27:30.560 --> 27:32.240
Um, you're Phoodin, right?

290
27:32.240 --> 27:33.240
Yes.

291
27:33.240 --> 27:34.720
Okay, you're up next.

292
27:34.720 --> 27:36.240
How was this morning? Did it go well?

293
27:36.240 --> 27:37.600
I think I did okay.

294
27:37.600 --> 27:40.280
Hmm. Nervous?

295
27:40.280 --> 27:41.520
Yes, I am.

296
27:41.520 --> 27:43.040
Oh, there's no need to be nervous.

297
27:43.040 --> 27:45.200
I peeked at your portfolio. You're in for sure.

298
27:45.200 --> 27:46.200
Thank you so much.

299
27:46.200 --> 27:47.760
Okay, wait here.

300
28:07.000 --> 28:10.360
Aren't you going to tell him, Rei?

301
28:10.840 --> 28:13.120
Yeah, I think you should tell him.

302
28:14.000 --> 28:16.640
You're going to study over there with no plans to come back.

303
28:18.320 --> 28:22.200
Nah. I think I'd better not.

304
28:22.640 --> 28:23.440
Forget it.

305
28:25.000 --> 28:26.640
You have to tell him, man.

306
28:26.640 --> 28:28.520
No way. You've got to tell him.

307
28:28.520 --> 28:29.520
No.

308
28:33.240 --> 28:35.880
Can you take notes for me? I'm going to the toilet.

309
28:35.880 --> 28:37.040
Sure, sure.

310
29:15.800 --> 29:16.920
Star.

311
29:17.880 --> 29:19.200
What's wrong?

312
29:19.760 --> 29:21.400
Don't you remember me?

313
29:22.760 --> 29:25.160
You smiled at me that day.

314
29:27.560 --> 29:28.560
Hey!

315
29:28.560 --> 29:29.680
Why are you running away?

316
29:30.720 --> 29:32.520
We know each other, don't we?

317
29:33.280 --> 29:34.560
It's me! / Hey!

318
29:34.560 --> 29:36.080
The one who gave you snacks.

319
29:36.080 --> 29:37.200
Can you let me go?

320
29:37.200 --> 29:38.880
Stay still! / Hey!

321
29:39.360 --> 29:41.000
And my snacks?

322
29:41.000 --> 29:42.880
Why'd you give them to other people?

323
29:44.040 --> 29:45.520
You led me on.

324
29:45.520 --> 29:46.800
And now

325
29:48.440 --> 29:50.080
I like you.

326
29:51.080 --> 29:52.280
Please let me go.

327
30:00.120 --> 30:01.920
Hey, where's Star?

328
30:01.920 --> 30:03.440
He went to the toilet a while ago.

329
30:03.440 --> 30:04.440
He's still not back.

330
30:04.440 --> 30:05.600
Thanks.

331
30:08.000 --> 30:08.720
Hey!

332
30:08.720 --> 30:09.560
Hey, what's wrong?

333
30:09.960 --> 30:10.960
Why are you hiding?

334
30:11.480 --> 30:13.160
I don't like this!

335
30:13.160 --> 30:14.880
You psycho!

336
30:20.200 --> 30:21.200
Star!

337
30:21.520 --> 30:22.520
Hey!

338
30:32.160 --> 30:33.160
Talk nicely?

339
30:33.800 --> 30:35.080
Talk nicely, huh?

340
30:37.560 --> 30:38.560
Look!

341
30:40.240 --> 30:42.920
Then why'd you cheat on me with him?

342
30:44.280 --> 30:48.760
But it doesn't matter anymore, because today you're mine.

343
30:48.760 --> 30:50.360
No, no!

344
30:52.680 --> 30:53.960
Help!

345
30:54.480 --> 30:55.480
Hold still.

346
30:56.280 --> 30:58.320
I said hold still!

347
31:00.680 --> 31:04.000
Help! Help me!

348
31:05.120 --> 31:07.040
Help!

349
31:18.480 --> 31:20.240
Help! / Star!

350
31:22.280 --> 31:23.800
What the fuck, you bastard?

351
31:24.920 --> 31:26.680
What are you doing, you animal?

352
31:27.560 --> 31:28.560
Rei!

353
31:29.480 --> 31:30.360
Let go of me, dammit!

354
31:30.360 --> 31:31.600
Shit, you'll kill him!

355
31:31.720 --> 31:32.720
Rei!

356
31:32.720 --> 31:33.480
Let go!

357
31:33.480 --> 31:34.480
Go check on Star.

358
31:34.480 --> 31:35.480
I'll handle this.

359
31:38.760 --> 31:39.760
Star.

360
31:45.640 --> 31:46.960
It's okay now, Star.

361
31:48.040 --> 31:49.680
That psycho can't hurt you anymore.

362
32:01.360 --> 32:02.240
Din.

363
32:03.360 --> 32:05.360
Star got attacked by a psycho.

364
32:18.360 --> 32:19.720
Star, are you okay?

365
32:32.000 --> 32:33.640
Does Din know yet?

366
32:47.040 --> 32:47.960
Star.

367
32:47.960 --> 32:49.200
Din...

368
33:14.320 --> 33:16.560
I'm sorry I'm late.

369
33:19.720 --> 33:21.640
Thanks for helping Star, man.

370
33:22.840 --> 33:24.760
Star's like a brother to me, too.

371
33:31.160 --> 33:31.960
Told your dad?

372
33:32.640 --> 33:34.360
Dad and Samai are on their way.

373
33:35.680 --> 33:37.600
Good. I'll stay with you.

374
33:38.280 --> 33:39.400
You're okay now.

375
33:47.240 --> 33:48.760
Star! / Dad!

376
33:51.680 --> 33:54.280
Are you okay, Star? Are you hurt anywhere?

377
33:55.360 --> 33:56.280
I'll take care of it.

378
33:57.720 --> 34:00.480
Din, please look after Star.

379
34:00.840 --> 34:01.600
Yes, sir.

380
34:02.360 --> 34:04.840
I'm sorry I didn't look after him better.

381
34:05.920 --> 34:07.760
Don't blame yourself.

382
34:07.760 --> 34:09.280
It's not your fault.

383
34:11.719 --> 34:12.800
I'll be right back.

384
34:14.520 --> 34:15.560
How's it going?

385
34:29.120 --> 34:31.120
I'll head off, then.

386
34:31.120 --> 34:32.320
Let's go, guys.

387
34:32.320 --> 34:33.320
Rei.

388
34:36.400 --> 34:37.880
Thank you, Rei.

389
34:37.880 --> 34:40.639
No problem. Like I said, you can always come to me.

390
34:41.320 --> 34:42.560
But you should tell him first.

391
34:43.600 --> 34:44.320
I'm off.

392
34:50.280 --> 34:51.199
Um, Din,

393
34:51.199 --> 34:53.239
please take care of Star.

394
35:02.600 --> 35:03.720
Din.

395
35:07.240 --> 35:09.120
Stay and talk with me for a bit.

396
35:22.320 --> 35:23.760
Does it hurt, Star?

397
36:05.760 --> 36:06.560
Din,

398
36:10.360 --> 36:11.720
you know what?

399
36:14.000 --> 36:15.600
When I was being attacked,

400
36:17.640 --> 36:19.600
besides my dad, the one I thought of

401
36:22.840 --> 36:23.960
was you.

402
36:28.840 --> 36:31.400
All I could think was that I can't die yet.

403
36:33.880 --> 36:35.520
I still want to see my dad.

404
36:36.680 --> 36:38.840
I still want to wake up and see you.

405
36:53.120 --> 36:54.360
You're so small.

406
36:55.480 --> 36:57.200
How are you this strong?

407
37:03.480 --> 37:05.080
I guess it's the love I get from my dad

408
37:08.200 --> 37:09.320
and from you.

409
37:11.280 --> 37:13.320
It tells me that if one day

410
37:13.320 --> 37:15.520
I start thinking about this again,

411
37:16.920 --> 37:18.560
I won't be alone.

412
37:27.720 --> 37:29.800
I promise I'll take good care of you.

413
37:37.600 --> 37:39.600
So...

414
37:39.600 --> 37:42.280
How did your exam go today?

415
38:05.160 --> 38:06.280
Hello?

416
38:06.640 --> 38:07.640
Din.

417
38:07.880 --> 38:10.120
Star got attacked by a psycho.

418
38:10.120 --> 38:11.680
But he's safe now.

419
38:11.680 --> 38:12.960
I called the police.

420
38:12.960 --> 38:14.800
Excuse me, you're up next.

421
38:14.800 --> 38:16.120
You okay?

422
38:16.120 --> 38:16.760
Okay.

423
38:21.040 --> 38:23.080
Is something wrong?

424
38:23.400 --> 38:24.640
Sorry?

425
38:26.520 --> 38:27.440
Nervous?

426
38:28.720 --> 38:30.400
You really want to study here?

427
38:31.560 --> 38:34.640
Um, I like the program here.

428
38:34.640 --> 38:37.520
I think I'd be happy studying here.

429
38:40.200 --> 38:44.200
Then tell me why you don't look happy at all.

430
38:57.320 --> 38:59.360
It's because of me, isn't it, Din?

431
38:59.760 --> 39:01.200
I just couldn't focus.

432
39:06.280 --> 39:09.000
Did you answer the professor?

433
39:13.680 --> 39:16.920
And what if they don't pass you? What will you do?

434
39:16.920 --> 39:19.800
It's fine, Star. I might still pass.

435
39:23.680 --> 39:25.680
This is my fault, isn't it, Din?

436
39:26.200 --> 39:28.080
If I hadn't gotten in your head,

437
39:28.080 --> 39:29.920
you'd have done fine.

438
39:30.880 --> 39:31.680
Star.

439
39:33.640 --> 39:34.640
Say I don't pass,

440
39:35.320 --> 39:36.360
I've got the quota round.

441
39:37.080 --> 39:39.240
So don't overthink it, okay?

442
39:39.240 --> 39:40.240
Trust me.

443
39:40.560 --> 39:42.240
I'll wait until results day.

444
39:43.760 --> 39:46.400
If you really don't get in,

445
39:47.640 --> 39:49.520
I'll be the one to tell your family.

446
40:42.640 --> 40:44.280
Why didn't you tell me?

447
40:48.760 --> 40:50.120
Who would've thought

448
40:51.120 --> 40:53.040
you'd just leave them sitting there?

449
40:54.000 --> 40:57.400
Well, you said to use them when the power's out.

450
40:58.520 --> 41:00.480
My power never goes out.

451
41:08.880 --> 41:10.760
"I like you. Give me a chance."

452
41:12.400 --> 41:14.720
"Can you not like anyone else? I get jealous."

453
41:23.040 --> 41:26.520
"Hope every day is a good day, and that you finally see I like you."

454
41:41.240 --> 41:42.800
Fuen.

455
41:46.280 --> 41:48.040
I gave you one every birthday.

456
41:52.520 --> 41:54.200
You even helped me hit on someone else.

457
41:56.480 --> 41:57.720
Well,

458
42:00.440 --> 42:01.960
you sweet-talked me.

459
42:04.280 --> 42:05.160
Hey.

460
42:08.600 --> 42:12.880
Ever been sweet-talked by someone you like?

461
42:16.600 --> 42:19.040
Right now.

462
42:23.720 --> 42:25.840
I'm not sweet-talking.

463
43:33.720 --> 43:35.840
Read the last message carefully.

464
43:43.240 --> 43:45.600
"I love you."

465
43:58.880 --> 44:00.400
If we get together,

466
44:00.760 --> 44:02.120
will we break up?

467
44:11.680 --> 44:14.120
I never saw you as just a friend to begin with.

468
44:20.160 --> 44:21.200
I won't break up.

469
44:45.120 --> 44:46.560
I love you, too.

470
45:39.760 --> 45:41.160
I've never kissed anyone before.

471
45:45.200 --> 45:46.760
As if I have.

472
46:32.480 --> 46:33.720
I liked it.

473
46:33.720 --> 46:35.240
Can I kiss you again?

474
46:57.640 --> 46:59.680
That's enough.

475
46:59.680 --> 47:00.680
Enough already?

476
47:02.080 --> 47:03.640
That's it?

477
47:34.800 --> 47:36.680
Argh!

478
47:38.920 --> 47:41.200
Why hasn't Din replied yet?

479
47:41.200 --> 47:43.800
Did something happen?

480
47:43.800 --> 47:44.800
Calm down.

481
47:44.800 --> 47:46.880
Maybe he's talking to his mom.

482
47:46.880 --> 47:48.600
He'll reply soon.

483
47:48.600 --> 47:49.600
Don't overthink it.

484
47:49.600 --> 47:50.600
Easy.

485
47:50.600 --> 47:51.680
There, there.

486
47:53.440 --> 47:55.240
I want to believe that,

487
47:56.040 --> 47:58.720
but what if Din really doesn't get in, Time?

488
47:59.880 --> 48:02.440
All we can do is comfort and support him, right?

489
48:02.760 --> 48:04.720
We can't do much more than that.

490
48:05.360 --> 48:07.080
Or do you think Din won't get in anywhere?

491
48:07.080 --> 48:08.680
No way.

492
48:09.320 --> 48:11.760
Exactly. I told you.

493
48:12.400 --> 48:14.840
Just wait for Din to reply. Don't overthink it.

494
48:34.240 --> 48:40.640
"Din, Star asked me to ask how your results turned out."

495
48:44.200 --> 48:47.640
Din, are your results out yet?

496
48:54.280 --> 48:58.000
If you want to decide for yourself, you have to deliver on what you said.

497
49:00.200 --> 49:01.200
Mom.

498
49:02.520 --> 49:03.840
I know you're worried,

499
49:04.760 --> 49:06.800
afraid I won't get in anywhere.

500
49:07.480 --> 49:09.120
But trust me.

501
49:11.080 --> 49:13.040
I'll get in through the quota round.

502
49:15.440 --> 49:18.600
Fine. But I have one more condition.

503
49:20.160 --> 49:21.680
If you don't get in this round,

504
49:21.680 --> 49:23.960
you'll go to the university I choose

505
49:23.960 --> 49:25.960
and the faculty I choose. Period.

506
49:30.760 --> 49:32.720
Do you understand me, Din?

507
49:54.640 --> 49:57.600
"Do you know he's been waiting for you? He took your words seriously."

508
49:57.600 --> 50:00.520
"But you left him. You vanished from his life. (Fuen)"

509
50:00.520 --> 50:02.200
"I'm going crazy. (Fuen)"

510
50:02.200 --> 50:06.800
"Sorry. We won't fight again, no matter what. (Physics)"

511
50:06.800 --> 50:09.600
"All I ask is one more chance."

512
50:09.600 --> 50:12.800
"I want you to get to know me before you decide. (Aof)"

513
50:12.800 --> 50:15.880
"If we're both still unsure of each other,"

514
50:15.880 --> 50:19.040
"why don't we try to make each other sure? (Star)"

515
50:19.040 --> 50:20.440
Confess.

516
50:20.440 --> 50:21.760
What about him?

517
50:22.480 --> 50:23.360
Does he like you?

518
50:24.400 --> 50:26.640
Guys, should we send the clip now?

519
50:26.640 --> 50:29.120
Send it. They say today's a lucky day,

520
50:29.120 --> 50:30.520
perfect for competing.

521
50:31.360 --> 50:31.960
Tired?

522
50:31.960 --> 50:34.600
Yeah, but I want to finish this page first.

523
50:35.240 --> 50:37.400
Smile. Be confident.

524
50:37.400 --> 50:38.840
Believe in yourself.

525
50:39.680 --> 50:43.880
Aof, I wrote a song. I'd like you to hear it.

526
50:46.000 --> 50:47.960
Your mom doesn't know about Star at all?

527
50:47.960 --> 50:49.320
I never told her.

528
50:49.320 --> 50:50.760
It'll be okay, right, Din?

529
50:50.760 --> 50:51.760
That's so scary.

530
50:52.480 --> 50:54.200
I don't know.
